Product name is "SaarthiAI". Use it in the app title, sidebar logo/header, page metadata
(<title>), login/register pages, and the README. Default BotConfig.botName = "SaarthiAI".This is an AI Customer Support SaaS platform. Monorepo: /client (Next.js 14 App Router,
TypeScript, Tailwind) and /server (Node.js, Express, TypeScript, Mongoose/MongoDB).
Vector DB is Pinecone (namespace per businessId). AI: OpenAI embeddings
(text-embedding-3-small, 1536 dims), chat via OpenAI gpt-4o-mini or Claude. Auth is JWT
(bcrypt) sent as Authorization: Bearer. RBAC roles: ADMIN, AGENT. Multi-tenant: every
query and every Pinecone namespace is scoped by businessId. Frontend deploys to Vercel,
backend to Render. Rules: always TypeScript; always scope data by businessId; keep
controllers thin and put logic in services; validate inputs; handle errors centrally;
write clean, responsive, production-quality UI.